{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "3c4f23d5193369afc42f748e15be7abb12d7fa44e63235786ead6fea7feb6b1b", "ja": "～日常～", "zh": "～日常～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a11f6e16c7033b3a6406c87dac60213d07f7040535084d262062b9e72a440972", "ja": "桃子が帰宅すると、ジュリアが鼻歌まじりに\n料理をしていた。自分も歌って打ち解けた桃\n子は、跡目を継ぐ事に悩んでいると話す。ジ\nュリアは、亡き組長なら桃子の幸せを願うだ\nろう、「極道を忘れな」と言うのだった。", "zh": "桃子回到家时，茱莉亚正哼着歌\n做饭。桃子也唱起歌来，渐渐敞开心扉，告诉\n她自己正为继承家业一事而烦恼。朱莉娅说，已\n故的组长一定会希望桃子幸福，并说道：“可别忘\n了极道。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1000_049mom", "source_sha256": "a271dc26f0c31a27a3ca328d4c14ef468877c136fa7332de48973eccc1646bda", "ja": "ただいま～……ん？　なんか、へんなにおい……。\nちょっと、ジュリアさん？　このにおい、何？", "zh": "我回来了～……嗯？怎么有股奇怪的味道……喂，茱莉亚，这是什么味道？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "18ac70f63e2bc630168d2fa63d7aeabfba3dcf8d052a73e6f96143033fd7e00b", "ja": "おかえり、お嬢。\n何って、料理だけど……。", "zh": "欢迎回来，大小姐。\n什么？做饭啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "e26b4bb21a667af654ebdec4df520cf6398ee72c3839d0f65fcd4abd82c6a74e", "ja": "……空を彩る　星に乗って　あたしは未来へ……\n願い事を　たくさん詰めた　鞄を握りしめ……♪", "zh": "……乘上点缀夜空的繁星　我向着未来……\n紧紧握住　装满愿望的提包……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "daa5756661131cebd7889bd1dc6bcbe0af13425f58a5ae56b18e1b298e7345c2", "ja": "へえ……いい歌だね。誰の曲？", "zh": "哇……真好听。这是谁的歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "fab0b092dce09c704e3373af770d1f37158a7f0335b8527fba725423d3489a09", "ja": "あたしの曲。", "zh": "我的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "3869517ff9a2787095a686120ee7cb02e1c48240d85c043661f30b8e3faaac92", "ja": "ほんとに？\nじゃあ、ジュリアさんは旅芸人なの？", "zh": "真的吗？\n那，茱莉亚先生是走江湖卖艺的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "196c0e2971277d04227ebb7836f935f550534e20ea5cd7ebe37ff80eeeb53395", "ja": "そうじゃないけど……立ち寄った街で、演奏する事は\nあるかな。それで多少、日銭を稼げるんでね。", "zh": "虽然不是……不过偶尔也会在途经的城镇演奏。靠这个多少能赚点日常开销。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "f92d12174d3ff16c4b354b3a0449d7d6ae55f180aae23130b1b429e034e03109", "ja": "そうなんだ……ねえ、桃子も歌いたい。\n桃子、長唄を習っていたから歌は上手だよ。", "zh": "这样啊……那个，桃子也想唱歌。\n桃子以前学过长呗，所以唱歌很拿手哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "9079ee3322681d5293d79f38346d2bbb13f98a6ef7e00982856280d5095b1d6c", "ja": "へえ！　そいつは聞かせてもらわないと。\n……さっきの曲でいいか？", "zh": "哦！那可得唱给我听听。\n……就唱刚才那首，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "e26b4bb21a667af654ebdec4df520cf6398ee72c3839d0f65fcd4abd82c6a74e", "ja": "……空を彩る　星に乗って　あたしは未来へ……\n願い事を　たくさん詰めた　鞄を握りしめ……♪", "zh": "……乘上点缀夜空的繁星　我向着未来……\n紧紧握住　装满愿望的提包……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "c4a2e6d19f346cbb5d78c9bba8107a3b62a5e05535133ed6f6b260b45a913ef7", "ja": "こりゃ驚いた。期待以上だよ。\nいいね。", "zh": "这可真让人吃惊。比预想的还要好。不错嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "aebc9bd285f7ec385b64a1168bee1178ee803ddd5199f929bfad4703ea5f2558", "ja": "桃子もジュリアさんと一緒に旅芸人、できる？\nあちこちを回って、歌ってお金を稼ぐの！", "zh": "桃子也能和茱莉亚先生一起当巡回艺人吗？\n到处跑，唱歌赚钱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "9e031ed93f76287f9d038a5e5359e413a9756e0e3cb93675b1f07507d9a67130", "ja": "ああ。お嬢ならきっと、どこに行っても売れっ子だ。\n……でも、お嬢を連れていっちゃったら環が寂しがる。", "zh": "啊。要是大小姐的话，无论去哪儿肯定都会很受欢迎。……不过，要是把大小姐带走了，环会寂寞的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "4362a527ae27aa1081401c9b9e63eeccc9553dc24ecc9ecd3f3a4ed8ff7ad399", "ja": "……環はやっぱり、桃子が\nお父さんの跡を継ぐことを期待してるみたい。", "zh": "……环果然还是希望桃子能继承爸爸的事业。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "9701a9935627c028046c31c979fd164f7d4213b5b99d0f805e8bf92a8d5d7a31", "ja": "でも……今、桃子がお父さんの跡を継いだら、\nまた同じことの繰り返し。また誰かが傷つくの……。", "zh": "可是……如果桃子现在就继承爸爸的事业，又会重蹈覆辙。又会有人受伤的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "3a78d7c2ce4c5c14cdf33d86571d9c8e0fe607144a3cdfc8f14cc49ae4ea2d20", "ja": "環は桃子のためなら一人でも頑張るって言ってくれる。\nでも、ダメなの。環に危ないこと……してほしくない。", "zh": "环说过，只要是为了桃子，就算一个人也会努力。\n可是，不行。我不想让环去做危险的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "15b0a198c9f5f8c710dc13f44efdeeeac21a44e6608d6fddc8583fb650460347", "ja": "なら、本当に全部捨てて、一緒に来るか？\nこんなちっぽけな商店街にこだわることなんてない。", "zh": "既然这样，真的要抛下一切，跟我一起走吗？\n没必要非得留恋这条小小的商店街。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "78affc9a21cb7a0d11c8caeb634a44509982e88a96f5679793054e2049ad761d", "ja": "住めば都ってね。人間、案外どこでだって暮らして\nいけるもんだ。今はこの街が全部かもしれないけど……", "zh": "所谓“住久了，哪里都是家”。人啊，其实意外地在哪儿都能生活下去。\n现在，这座城市或许就是你的全部，但……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "361e2a35a231f71d00cd873e35dc3edc920ef2a98848cffeee7c5bfcc19e1169", "ja": "世界ってのは広いんだぜ？　遠い土地にいけば、\n故郷のことなんてコロッと忘れられるさ。", "zh": "世界可是很广阔的啊？只要去了遥远的地方，就能把故乡的事忘得一干二净。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "435d7c00aa26d3d1c4e9f60c32bf2602c86c4fe62c50ae93aa4849d255007542", "ja": "で、でも……！\nそれじゃ、お父さんやみんなの気持ちが……。", "zh": "可、可是……！\n那样的话，爸爸和大家的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "eabafe489f3553f80e5b8b55bbef4613084ec8a6446edb0868fa79632ae90f59", "ja": "お嬢。極道ってのは、\nなまなかな覚悟でなっちゃあいけない。", "zh": "小姐，黑道这条路，可不是靠半吊子的觉悟就能走上的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "45087fed857bdf95e0a927e1d6808c5a414c797e360dd58b643e832d44722653", "ja": "お嬢の幸せが、死んだ親分さんにとっても、\n一番の願いだったはずさ。", "zh": "大小姐的幸福，对已经去世的老大来说，也一定是最大的愿望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "a45cb8b9d92f8850732e553b9b384bc355cbc86439f5057caf02fa57196e3d7c", "ja": "でも……。", "zh": "可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "9101718b5c9dbe6753db896f6e145e9767ef4351841b82c0f7e3e25614928b3b", "ja": "お嬢の手は、あんなにうまい料理を作れるじゃないか。\n血で染めるなんてもったいない。", "zh": "大小姐的手，明明能做出那么好吃的料理。拿来染上鲜血，太可惜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "2359fad283b303a719130a51a454b06c0ecf2e47c173cabda4a7fa4d40a80570", "ja": "だから、極道のことは忘れな。", "zh": "所以，忘了极道那回事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "99b1cae8a7eff7b9a8d035c6420647bb251b92aae72f1dfd1ee388c3b7f89560", "ja": "ただいま～！\nくふふ、たんけんで宝物いっぱい見つけたぞ。", "zh": "我回来啦～！\n嘿嘿，在探险时发现了好多宝物哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "543c65654cf32e0e739ecb086c41226d4155599f6b543e48c70a6e9312b708df", "ja": "おーい、じゅりあ。\nこっち来て運ぶの手伝って！", "zh": "喂，朱莉亚。到这边来帮忙搬东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "8510ddf8cc44ff8aa2f5b5d5e5c55321dd7ef48b75069e7ecf8ecd10ba8d888e", "ja": "ああ。今、行くよ。", "zh": "啊，我这就来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_03_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "a24991b8cd277a65b026f763cb849f7fedb21b3795a87ee028c0ccc55a92515a", "ja": "なによ、わかったようなことばっかり言って……。", "zh": "真是的，净说些好像什么都明白的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
